stateDiagram-v2
[_] --> prepared: Store work id and reply key
prepared --> submitted: Relay accepts caller ids
prepared --> failed: Authorization, runtime, or key failure
prepared --> canceled: Owner cancels before submission
submitted --> submitted: Save progress cursor and next poll time
submitted --> proposed: Open completed result and propose comment
submitted --> failed: Expiry, access loss, invalid ciphertext, or remote failure
submitted --> canceled: Owner or daemon cancels
proposed --> completed: Owner approves and comment applies
proposed --> failed: Approved comment fails
proposed --> canceled: Owner rejects or cancels
completed --> [_]
failed --> [_]
canceled --> [_]
